Gaia DR3 star file: gaia-dr3-g11.vcat
=====================================

Star positions, G magnitudes and BP-RP colours from Gaia Data Release 3, down to G = 11.
Valerian reads this file at run time (valerian solve, valerian photocal). It is data, a
separate file, and is NOT part of the GPL code of Valerian.

